   "start": 103.26983333333334,
   "end": 104.7046,
   "transcript": "It wasn't a therapist,",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "sdJ1ku5nGcg_010135-010415.mkv",
   "start": 107.107,
   "end": 110.7106,
   "transcript": "it wasn't my mom or dad that saved my life. It was his bank teller, Rhonda Jackson,",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "sdJ1ku5nGcg_010135-010415.mkv",
   "start": 12.746066666666668,
   "end": 14.2142,
   "transcript": "I go into this jail cell.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "sdJ1ku5nGcg_010135-010415.mkv",
   "start": 14.6146,
   "end": 16.3163,
   "transcript": "I tell them I don't want to call anyone.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "sdJ1ku5nGcg_010135-010415.mkv",
   "start": 24.657966666666667,
   "end": 26.026,
   "transcript": "They let me out the next morning.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "sdJ1ku5nGcg_010135-010415.mkv",
   "start": 31.79843333333333,
   "end": 33.600233333333335,
   "transcript": "I broke into my dad's office.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "sdJ1ku5nGcg_010135-010415.mkv",
   "start": 39.70633333333333,
   "end": 41.97526666666667,
   "transcript": "Made out a check for myself for $5,000",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "sdJ1ku5nGcg_010135-010415.mkv",
   "start": 53.6536,
   "end": 58.1581,
   "transcript": "I'll never forget, I walk into this PNC bank in Camden, New Jersey. I have this check in my hand.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "sdJ1ku5nGcg_010135-010415.mkv",
   "start": 58.1581,
   "end": 58.825433333333336,
   "transcript": "At the time I'm",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "sdJ1ku5nGcg_010135-010415.mkv",
   "start": 62.295566666666666,
   "end": 64.79806666666667,
   "transcript": "basically smoking crack and shooting heroin all day",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "sdJ1ku5nGcg_010135-010415.mkv",
   "start": 82.01526666666666,
   "end": 82.91616666666667,
   "transcript": "the bank teller",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "sdJ1ku5nGcg_010135-010415.mkv",
   "start": 83.7837,
   "end": 87.3873,
   "transcript": "behind the counter took one look at me and she knew something was up",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "sdJ1ku5nGcg_010135-010415.mkv",
   "start": 91.2912,
   "end": 93.1931,
   "transcript": "And at that moment she could have had me arrested",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "sdJ1ku5nGcg_010135-010415.mkv",
   "start": 95.12836666666666,
   "end": 97.56413333333333,
   "transcript": "but instead she said like, one minute, Mr. Clark,",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "sdJ1ku5nGcg_010135-010415.mkv",
   "start": 99.53276666666666,
   "end": 100.6005,
   "transcript": "and she went and called my dad.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "sdJ1ku5nGcg_010135-010415.mkv",
   "start": 120.95416666666667,
   "end": 124.89143333333334,
   "transcript": "They had filed a missing person report and he just said, Rhonda, please keep my son there.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "sdJ1ku5nGcg_010135-010415.mkv",
   "start": 141.8417,
   "end": 144.71123333333333,
   "transcript": "And my dad, white as a ghost, came through the doors of that bank",
   "no_refine": true
  },
